add("BG002","M116",0,"The product (V\\C)×int J is open in V×R.",[[a+"0/text","C is closed and J is the declared real interval."],[d+"0/definition","The space-time topology is the ordinary product Euclidean topology."]],"Both factors are open (interior is open). IsOpen.prod applies. Since int J lies in positive time, this is an open subset of the given domain, as needed by the displayed local-constancy argument.");
