add("BG011","M107",3,"One-dimensional real Lebesgue measure is locally finite.",[[d+"0/definition","Every coordinate factor of dx is real Lebesgue measure."]],"Real.locallyFinite_volume is the actual proved instance for the usual real volume. It applies to precisely the factor measures in D001.");
add("BG012","M119",3,"Each real Lebesgue factor is finite on compact sets.",[[d+"0/definition","The factors of dx are real Lebesgue measures with their real topology."]],"BG011 supplies local finiteness. The successfully probed root declaration isFiniteMeasureOnCompacts_of_isLocallyFiniteMeasure yields finite-on-compacts. The earlier rejected namespaced selector supplies no evidence and is not used.");
